@prefix alm: <https://auditlayer.com/ontology/alm#> .

# INVALID fixture — invariant: immutable_projection (ReportVersionShape).
# A ReportVersion asserted as an Audit. Reports are immutable audience
# projections of a pinned run; conflating the projection with the queue/billing
# unit breaks the projection boundary (and the report never replaces the
# Subject). SQL enforces UPDATE/DELETE rejection; SHACL enforces the typed
# projection disjointness.
alm:rep1 a alm:ReportVersion, alm:Audit .
